```

The function makes an API call to `OpenRoomMembersPage`. This API call is supposed to return the full list of members for the room. The `optimisticData` sets `isOptimisticReport` to true, which is probably used to show a loading indicator. The `successData` and `failureData` set it back to `false`.

The problem is that the `report.participants` object is not being updated with the members. This could be because the API call is failing, or the data is not being merged correctly into Onyx.

I will now check the API command `OpenRoomMembersPage` in `src/libs/API/types.ts` to see what it does.

